{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make words that let you make words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find words in a randomized grid of letters. The used letters will leave empty spaces, which the other letters can bridge, allowing for words that weren't possible before, over larger and larger areas. And if words aren't helping, you can also use bombs to clear up blocking letters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score depends on both the length of the word, and the size of the area it spans. Make longer words over bigger areas to score more points and reach the level's goal before the timer runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/extras/fbfdef0a8c2993092a5ead220f64695f.poster.avif?t=1756126663\" width=616 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/extras/fbfdef0a8c2993092a5ead220f64695f.webm?t=1756126663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/extras/fbfdef0a8c2993092a5ead220f64695f.mp4?t=1756126663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But it's also a roguelike?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to complete the level, you will be presented with 3 pairs of pants for 3 different letters. Pants give unique bonuses to letters, a letter can be worth more, or maybe it multiplies the whole word\u2019s value, or maybe it gives you bombs or does other things!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And there's a museum involved??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig through the letters, you also dig through the dirt. Beneath the earth you will find objects lost to time. (and to their owners) Uncover these sometimes-precious items, sell them, and expand your museum, then place the items in the museum and unlock new gameplay modifiers as the museum\u2019s collection completes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plays entirely with the mouse. An average run may last 15 to 30 minutes.\u00a0You may play with the English, French, or Spanish dictionary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659750?t=1756126663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659750?t=1756126663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/c6c600c482a9f4fe3baf86d09d309c383e74a4a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756126663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/c6c600c482a9f4fe3baf86d09d309c383e74a4a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756126663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make words that let you make words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find words in a randomized grid of letters. The used letters will leave empty spaces, which the other letters can bridge, allowing for words that weren't possible before, over larger and larger areas. And if words aren't helping, you can also use bombs to clear up blocking letters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score depends on both the length of the word, and the size of the area it spans. Make longer words over bigger areas to score more points and reach the level's goal before the timer runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/extras/fbfdef0a8c2993092a5ead220f64695f.poster.avif?t=1756126663\" width=616 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/extras/fbfdef0a8c2993092a5ead220f64695f.webm?t=1756126663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/extras/fbfdef0a8c2993092a5ead220f64695f.mp4?t=1756126663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But it's also a roguelike?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to complete the level, you will be presented with 3 pairs of pants for 3 different letters. Pants give unique bonuses to letters, a letter can be worth more, or maybe it multiplies the whole word\u2019s value, or maybe it gives you bombs or does other things!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And there's a museum involved??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig through the letters, you also dig through the dirt. Beneath the earth you will find objects lost to time. (and to their owners) Uncover these sometimes-precious items, sell them, and expand your museum, then place the items in the museum and unlock new gameplay modifiers as the museum\u2019s collection completes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plays entirely with the mouse. An average run may last 15 to 30 minutes.\u00a0You may play with the English, French, or Spanish dictionary.</p>","developers":["PUNKCAKE D\u00e9licieux"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659750/fde7063dd0eca4b313069addaf6f69d80be8d1db/header.jpg?t=1756126663","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any 64-bit distro</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.7 OSX Lion<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3659750/1959674720/992d557361e3fd672ef7ba9175